It reads, and when the user allows it changes, the data of the Alpha ESS
systems of the user through the official Alpha ESS Open API
(https://open.alphaess.com), with the AppID and AppSecret of the user's own
developer account. This integration is not affiliated with nor endorsed by
Alpha ESS. The endpoints, fields, units and return codes follow the portal
documentation as transcribed and checked against the live API by the
"alphaess-openAPI" library (https://github.com/CharlesGillanders/alphaess-openAPI,
MIT License); its scope follows the Home Assistant "Alpha ESS" integration
(https://github.com/CharlesGillanders/homeassistant-alphaESS). No code is
taken from either.
